              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tobias+Fritz"} Tobias Fritz
                and Eigil Fjeldgren Rischel,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Infinite products and zero-one laws in categorical probability
                = succeed ")" do
